Subject: [PATCH] libmount: include resolver definitions in the idmap caller

Local integration prerequisite for the upstream restricted-source pinning
backport. hook_idmap now uses RESOLVE_NO_SYMLINKS, whose portable fallback is
provided by include/fileutils.h added by the upstream openat2 wrapper patch.
Include that existing private header, matching context.c and utils.c; retain
all original idmap and mountfd capability/configure guards.

--- a/libmount/src/hook_idmap.c
+++ b/libmount/src/hook_idmap.c
@@ -24,6 +24,7 @@
 #include "strutils.h"
 #include "all-io.h"
 #include "namespace.h"
+#include "fileutils.h"
 
 #include "mountP.h"
 
